## Notes

Claude Mythos 5.1 appears to be a restricted/enterprise-only variant of Claude Fable 5.1 with relaxed cybersecurity and life-sciences safeguards for vetted enterprise users. As of 2026-09-23, no independent public benchmark results are available from Artificial Analysis, BenchLeader, BenchmarkList, or other public benchmarking sources. This is consistent with its enterprise-only distribution model - benchmarks may exist internally at Anthropic or for vetted enterprise customers but are not publicly disclosed.

The model shares architecture and likely performance characteristics with Claude Fable 5.1, but without public benchmark data, scores cannot be independently verified. Any scores would be speculation based on the Fable 5.1 family, which violates the no-hallucination rule.

